E
logbook log book blackwake~
The Pirate King's log, in a sloping, elegant hand.  The last entry reads:
"Took the Sea Wren off the cape.  Fine haul.  Prisoners to the brig.  If
they ever come for me - and one day someone will - I shall go up to my
light, where I can see them coming, and they shall have to come up the
stair one at a time.  I will not hang in Elrhinn.  I will not."
~
